			"notes": "## Fixed\n\n- Weeping creepers now despawn when the difficulty is set to Peaceful, matching vanilla creepers. In Minecraft 26.1 this is a per-entity-type flag (`EntityType.isAllowedInPeaceful`) rather than behavior inherited from the monster category, and the weeping creeper's type was missing the opt-out — so they previously lingered on Peaceful instead of disappearing."
